### Standard TypeScript Utility Types

Use built-in utility types instead of reinventing them:

| Utility Type       | Purpose                                    | Example                                     |
|--------------------|--------------------------------------------|---------------------------------------------|
| `Partial<T>`      | All properties optional                    | `Partial<SearchConfig>` for update payloads  |
