Pre-write pass: extending the existing `UsageSnapshot` and `CacheStats` shapes is the smallest move. Building nothing fails the requested distinction, while a new module or test file adds no value. The owning path is `index.ts`, with internal consumers at normalization, accounting, persistence parsing, footer formatting and stats output. The persisted v6 JSON shape is the shared contract, and old readers ignore an added field, so rollback is a working-tree revert of `index.ts` and the affected tests. No persisted user file will be changed by the test fixtures.
