codex
The red control behaved as intended: the new accounting, normalization and migration assertions failed against the unchanged implementation, including the positive-input `hasMissingUsageFields` case. I’ll preserve the existing numeric usage shape and carry the field-presence decision as an internal `hasCacheSignal` marker, with a compatibility fallback for direct test snapshots that already contain explicit zero fields. Costs and token totals will remain on the unconditional path.
