codex
Implemented the cache-signal fix in [index.ts](/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.pi/extensions/pi-cache-optimizer/index.ts:265).

- Preserves cache-field presence through Pi and raw adapters.
- Adds persisted `unmeasuredRequests`, with migration default `0`.
- Records tokens and costs for all measured/unmeasured usage.
- Excludes only unmeasured requests from hit ratios.
- Shows unmeasured counts in stats output.

Tests added or updated in [cache-economics.test.ts](/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.pi/extensions/pi-cache-optimizer/tests/cache-economics.test.ts:123):

- Input-only usage: unmeasured, tokens/costs retained.
- Explicit zero fields: measured miss.
- Undefined usage: no-op.
- Migration: counters preserved and new field defaults to zero.
- Stats output: unmeasured count visible and excluded from ratio.

The reverted implementation failed these regression cases. Final verification:

- `npm --prefix .pi/extensions/pi-cache-optimizer run check`: exit `0`
- 103 tests passed, 0 failed
- All three code-alignment guards passed
- Only the package’s three files are modified
- No commit created
